1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,210
Paperwork can be exhausting when typing is difficult. UNBOUND Access asks one question at a time.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:14,565
This edited demo uses real app screens, fictional typed answers, and synthetic narration. It is not continuous voice capture.

3
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:22,730
Optional Meta Llama three point two, with three billion parameters, runs in the browser and proposes each question's answer type.

4
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:29,400
For this authored bicycle repair form, the smaller one billion parameter model matched two of eight types and was rejected.

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:37,155
The three billion parameter model matched all eight. Exact requests and unchanged responses are saved in the public repository.

6
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:45,770
That is one development case, not an independent accuracy benchmark. CPU extraction took about one hundred sixty three seconds.

7
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:53,310
The source asks for a contact name, an email, a date, a budget, a problem description, and three address rows.

8
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:59,655
Both home rows refer to one fact. The workshop is a different fact, even though all three ask for an address.

9
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:07,730
The app derives labels, pages, required flags, and repeated facts from the source. Those are not credited as model output.

10
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:15,675
This screen replays that saved proposal through manual import. The person checks every question and shared fact before approving it.

11
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:23,855
Every answer still needs confirmation. A separate real Meta call interpreted zero dollars as zero, in about ninety five seconds.

12
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:30,320
The model never saves that proposal automatically. The person can cancel it, correct it, or confirm it.

13
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:38,105
Here, correcting the home address proposes both copies together. Confirmation changes them to one hundred one Practice Street.

14
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:45,310
The workshop stays at nine hundred Separate Venue Road. A shared fact never silently becomes somebody else's address.

15
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:53,470
After reviewing the answers, the person checks the acknowledgement and prepares the PDF. Save and Open links remain available.

16
00:01:53,680 --> 00:02:01,230
This is the actual one page file downloaded in the earlier three billion parameter browser workflow, with fictional information.

17
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:08,710
The file preserved both corrected home addresses, the separate workshop address, and the zero budget. Nothing was signed or submitted.

18
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:16,920
The latest reliability checks kept sixty long corrections through a refresh. Contradictory follow up answers block a reviewed record.

19
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:24,825
One hundred seven automated checks pass. These are engineering tests, not model accuracy or proof of universal accessibility.

20
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:33,725
The three billion parameter model is an optional two point zero two gigabyte download. No API key, payment card, or paid fallback is needed.

21
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:41,755
A tester reported the repaired phone PDF download worked. Full hands free completion and measured usability remain unverified.

22
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:49,940
Try the app, review the original model receipts, and inspect the source. Every confirmed answer stays under the person's control.

